    <sys:String x:Key="AboutTitle">About Egg Launcher</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AboutProductTab">Product</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="IndependentOpenLocal">Independent, Open Source, Local First</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AboutProductBody">Egg Launcher is an independently developed open-source Windows tool that coordinates ChatGPT Desktop online environments with llama.cpp local inference environments. It does not provide AI models or online AI services, and it does not bypass third-party accounts, licenses, or access restrictions.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseBoundary">Current Release Scope</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ReleaseBoundaryBody">This release is a public beta. Core mode switching, local runtime, and recovery flows have been validated; online model search and download remain experimental. The package does not bundle llama.cpp, CUDA Runtime, GGUF models, or other user-selected inference runtimes. The application's open-source dependencies are listed in the third-party notices.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Developer">Developer</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="SoftwareLicense">License</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="DataHandling">Data Handling</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="DataHandlingValue">No developer server · No outbound telemetry · Stored locally</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="UsePrivacyTab">Privacy</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="FreeAndUse">Free Use</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="FreeAndUseBody">Egg Launcher is provided free of charge under the MIT License. Model downloads, network traffic, electricity, hardware, and third-party services may incur costs and remain subject to their respective terms. The software is provided “as is,” without a promise of permanent maintenance or compatibility with every third-party version.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ViewTerms">View Terms and Disclaimer</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="PrivacySummary">Privacy Summary</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="PrivacySummaryBody">This release has no Egg Launcher account or developer server. It sends no usage analytics, behavior tracking, crash reports, or local performance samples to the developer or third parties. Settings, model profiles, recovery records, and diagnostic logs remain on this device. CPU, memory, GPU, VRAM, and local llama metrics are used only for the current interface.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ViewPrivacy">View Full Privacy Notice</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LocalDataDirectory">Local Data Directory</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LocalDataBody">Model and Runtime data remain in the llama.cpp directory selected by the user. Removing the application files does not automatically remove that data.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="OpenSourceTab">Licenses</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="EggMitBody">Copyright © 2026 甲总不是贾总. Permission is granted to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, or sell copies of this software while retaining the copyright and license notice. The complete terms are provided in the LICENSE file distributed with the software.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ViewMitLicense">View MIT License</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ThirdPartyNotices">Third-Party Notices</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ThirdPartyBody">Open-source dependencies retain their respective copyrights and licenses. The self-contained package includes .NET Runtime components and their license files, but it does not include llama.cpp or models. User-acquired inference runtimes, models, and data remain subject to their respective owners' licenses.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ViewThirdParty">View Third-Party Licenses</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="IndependenceTrademark">Independence and Trademarks</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="IndependenceTrademarkBody">Egg Launcher is not affiliated with, partnered with, sponsored by, or endorsed by OpenAI, ChatGPT, llama.cpp, ggml, Hugging Face, or their respective owners. Related names, trademarks, software, and copyrights belong to their respective owners.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="CopyVersionInfo">Copy Version Info</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="OfflineDocumentHint">This document is included offline with the current release and can be selected and copied.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="CopyAll">Copy All</sys:String>

