    <sys:String x:Key="CloseEggTitle">Close Egg Launcher</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LocalServiceRunning">Local background services are still running</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LocalServiceCloseBody">Closing only the window keeps Egg Launcher and its services in the system tray. Stopping the services releases the program directory, but the current Local client can no longer send requests. Saved mode and model settings are not switched back or deleted.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="CloseWindowOnly">Close Window Only</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="StopServiceAndExit">Stop Services and Exit</sys:String>
